      "en": "He said to him, “If now I have found favor in your sight, then show me a sign that it is you who talk with me.",
      "ko": "기드온이 그에게 대답하되 내가 주께 은혜를 얻었사오면 나와 말씀하신 이가 주 되시는 표징을 내게 보이소서",
      "source_text_hash": "b20a52f8b797befaa1ac90287f07446268cdfa99f3a186d390860ed7af02018f",
      "translation_text_hash": "4da418e6f43449f1f0730459af08d02e411fad0b6171bf9d48024d6fb3ae337e",
