      "en": "Then the men of the city said to Joash, “Bring out your son, that he may die, because he has broken down the altar of Baal, and because he has cut down the Asherah that was by it.”",
      "ko": "성읍 사람들이 요아스에게 이르되 네 아들을 끌어내라 그는 당연히 죽을찌니 이는 바알의 단을 훼파하고 단 곁의 아세라를 찍었음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0d06b99333de17cc95727264d107186ac5aabe61767fa8704ef6c9e164eb32a8",
      "translation_text_hash": "5fedd7f6793acad41026e08e145fe261986705ae67d2ac57d604139b985c407f",
